## Throne

::bg{location="throne" time="night"}
<branch id="crownChoice" prompt="The crown is within reach.">
  <choice id="wear" text="Put it on">
    @ilo{code="0010" mono}: It's cold. It's so cold. It fits.
    @narrator{code="0010"}: Far above, the sea around the Gull's Mercy goes flat and bright, and stays that way.
    ::set{user.crowned = true}
    ::end{reason="crowned"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" text="Leave it where it is">
    @ilo{code="0020" mono}: Not yet. Not while they're still waiting up there.
    @narrator{code="0020"}: He swims back up through a palace that lets him go.
  </choice>
</branch>
